.TH NC-NOTIFY 1 "2026-11-17" "nc-notify 1.0.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
nc-notify \- reminders for Nextcloud calendars and Deck cards
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nc-notify
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Tray application for Astra Linux (Fly) and other Qt5 desktops.
It synchronises Nextcloud calendars over CalDAV and Deck cards over the Deck API,
shows upcoming events and cards, and sends reminders through the desktop
notification service (fly-notifications) and its own popup window.
The application password is stored in the system keyring.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-minimized
Start hidden in the system tray.
.TP
.B \-\-verbose
Print informational messages to the terminal.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print version and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-curl\-info
Print libcurl GSS-API/SPNEGO capabilities and exit (Kerberos diagnostics).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/nc-notify/nc-notify.conf
Settings (no passwords).
.TP
.I ~/.config/autostart/nc-notify.desktop
Autostart entry, managed from the settings dialog.
.SH NOTES
Create an application password in Nextcloud: Settings \- Security \- Devices and sessions.
.SH AUTHOR
Andrew. Program author: Qwen (AI assistant, Alibaba Group).
